# Crash's eight presets are a single hit. On the sequence screen, knob 2 can write many.
seed 42
reboot
wait 40
tapkey b10
barwait
tap SEQ
expect iamseq 1
spin SELECT 3
wait 30
expect toast CRASH
spin K2 1
wait 30
expect toast STEPS
expect toast2 12
expect stepv10 60095
expect iamhel 0
expect iamwob0 0
